.TH ispconfig-key-websites 1 "2026-05-13" "0.6.0" "ISPConfig Zabbix Monitoring"
.SH NAME
ispconfig-key-websites \- retrieve ISPConfig website metrics for Zabbix
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ispconfig-key-websites
.I website_id
.I key
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ispconfig-key-websites
queries the ISPConfig SOAP API for a specific metric of an individual website.
It is called by Zabbix Agent 2 for each discovered website.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I website_id
The numeric website domain ID (as discovered by
.BR ispconfig-discovery-websites (1)).
.TP
.I key
The metric key to retrieve. Available keys:
.RS
.TP
.B active
Website active status (0/1).
.TP
.B domain
Domain name.
.TP
.B server_id
Server ID.
.TP
.B document_root
Document root path.
.TP
.B php_version
PHP version string.
.TP
.B ssl_enabled
SSL enabled status (0/1).
.TP
.B traffic
Traffic in bytes.
.TP
.B disk_usage
Disk usage in bytes.
.TP
.B hd_quota
Hard disk quota in bytes.
.RE
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/ispconfig-zabbix-monitoring/config.php
Configuration file with ISPConfig API credentials.
.TP
.I /usr/lib/ispconfig-zabbix-monitoring/keys/websites.php
PHP script executed by this launcher.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR ispconfig-discovery-websites (1),
.BR ispconfig-key-emails (1),
.BR ispconfig-key-mail-domains (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Spoje-NET <info@spoje.net>
